1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:04,960
Air Force leadership from around the Pacific convened at Yokota

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:08,160
Air Base for a safety-board president course intended to

3
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,000
prepare them should they ever need to serve as a

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,480
board president on a mishap investigation board.

5
00:00:12,965 --> 00:00:15,925
The course prepares members to serve on a safety investigation

6
00:00:15,925 --> 00:00:19,925
board designed to prevent future mishaps, where information is confidential,

7
00:00:20,005 --> 00:00:22,805
or on an accident investigation board, where the findings will

8
00:00:22,805 --> 00:00:24,245
be released to the public.

9
00:00:24,245 --> 00:00:27,205
It does provide clarity into the situation, and we

10
00:00:27,205 --> 00:00:29,310
want to make sure we have the best-trained personnel

11
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:31,790
who are going to be doing these investigations,

12
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,910
primarily because we want to get the best answer to the

13
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:38,110
next of kin in explaining what happened to their loved

14
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:39,630
one in the final moments.

15
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:42,510
And we also need that transparency of government to explain

16
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:45,675
what happened to an aircraft or an operational asset if

17
00:00:45,675 --> 00:00:46,715
